  "description": "Step back in time with this set of 12 unique digital papers featuring vintage pop-art women from the 1920s, dressed in beautiful flapper outfits, inspired by old comic books.\nThese high-resolution PNGs, with transparent backgrounds, are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them ideal for adding a touch of roaring twenties elegance to your creative projects.\nPerfect for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a sophisticated and stylish twist to your designs.\nUse them to create eye-catching pieces that capture the glamour and flair of the 1920s with a vintage pop-art vibe.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step back in time with this set of 12 unique digital papers featuring vintage pop-art women from the 1920s, dressed in beautiful flapper outfits, inspired by old comic books.</p>\n<p>These high-resolution PNGs, with transparent backgrounds, are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them ideal for adding a touch of roaring twenties elegance to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>Perfect for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a sophisticated and stylish twist to your designs.</p>\n<p>Use them to create eye-catching pieces that capture the glamour and flair of the 1920s with a vintage pop-art vibe.</p>",
